    "A reproducible pinned UCTP patch composes exact signed native full-batch confirmation with sealed Core replacement resource activation, preserving ordinary initial activation checks. Actual negotiated audio is muted at controller revision 2, with media_ready false.",
    "A fresh provisional media origin stores no idle authority reader. Public publish/receive remain denied. Identical same-physical replay returns original progress without new effects or resource IO.",
    "Historical success or uncertainty is retained before its metadata await; recording can reuse the held target interval. Wrong signed parameters cancel the owned local candidate and cannot retry. Exact native runtime/generation retirement can settle uncertain local resources, but never a possibly started movement commit or foreign callback.",
    "Public cancellation, separate controller revocation, target endpoint revocation and target key revocation retire only the provisional candidate and release Core preparation capacity. The original decoded audio/observer role remains intact."
  ],
